    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "An excellent opportunity to acquire a superb three bedroom end-of-terrace home ideally positioned at the end of a quiet cul-de-sac and overlooking a pleasant green area. Only five years old this energy-efficient A-rated property is presented in excellent condition throughout and offers modern, spacious and well-appointed accommodation.\r\nThe ground floor comprises a welcoming entrance hallway with useful under-stairs storage, a bright and comfortable living room, and an impressive kitchen/dining room with double doors opening onto the south-facing rear garden.  A separate utility room and guest WC complete the ground floor accommodation.\r\nUpstairs, there are three well proportioned bedrooms, including a main bedroom with en-suite together with a stylish family bathroom.\r\nThe home benefits from underfloor air to water heating on the ground floor with radiators providing heating on the first floor.\r\nExternally, the property features a cobbled double driveway to the front with side-gate access to the rear gardens. \r\nBeing situated on a corner site the property also enjoys the significant benefit of an additional side garden providing excellent outdoor space.\r\nThe property is conveniently located with easy access to a wide range of local services, amenities, schools and transport links, making it an ideal choice for modern family living."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance / Hallway\r\nComposite front door, glass side panel leading to entrance hallway, tiled floor, centre light, under-stair storage, burglar alarm panel.\r\n\r\nLiving room (4.42 m × 3.68 m)\r\nLaminate wood floor, feature bay style window with window blinds facing front of property, built-in electric fire, centre light.\r\n\r\nOpen Plan Kitchen / Dining room\r\n(5.08m × 4.22m)\r\nTiled floor throughout, shaker-style kitchen at floor and eye level, oven, ceramic hob with stainless steel extractor over, integrated dishwasher, window facing side of property, and French double doors to rear exiting into garden, recessed lighting. \r\n\r\nUtility (1.52m × 1.30m)\r\nTiled floor, plumbed for washing machine and dishwasher with work counter over, storage units, centre light and window facing rear of property.\r\n\r\nGuest WC (1.60m × 1.47m)\r\nTiled floor, WC, WHB, centre light and expelair. \r\n\r\nStairs/ Landing\r\nCarpet floor covering, radiator, centre light, styra stairs with access to attic for storage purposes.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 (3.56 meters x 3.35)\r\nLaminate wood floor, extensive built-in wardrobes, feature bay style window with window blinds, curtain and curtain rail facing front of property, radiator, centre light.\r\n\r\nEn-Suite (2.59m × 1.02m)\r\nWC, WHB, shower, power shower, floor and wall tiles, LED wall mirror, centre light, xpelair and window with frosted glass facing side of property.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 (3.45m × 2.82m)\r\nCarpet floor covering, built-in wardrobes, radiator centre light and window blind facing rear of property. \r\n\r\nBedroom 3 (2.59m × 1.02m)\r\nLaminate wood floor, radiator central light and window with window blinds facing rear of property.\r\n\r\nBathroom (2.26m × 2.08m) \r\nWC, WHB, bath with shower and shower door over, tiled floor and walls, fitted vanity unit, radiator, centre light, xpelair, window with frosted glass facing front of property.\r\n\r\nOutside\r\nTo the front - cobbled off street parking for two vehicles with gardens laid to lawn and side gate access to rear.\r\nTo the rear – enclosed south facing gardens incorporating patio and gardens laid to lawn, outside lighting."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "3 bedroom end of terrace in excellent condition throughout.\r\nSituated on a corner site at the end of a cul-de-sac.\r\nFacing a green with no house opposite.\r\nEnergy efficient A rated property c. 5 years old. \r\nSouth facing rear gardens."
      },
